  a Probe or Lookup step on a HEAP relation has no index to
  descend and walks the chain instead: `examined` far above
  `rows` is that, and is what --bars-clustered heap measures.
  read-bar-lookup is the clean read of it. No Waystone trail hides
  it on the joins: nothing records without WAYSTONE ON, and this
  driver opts no shape in (docs/spec/waystone-concpets.md).

